# Line endings, made deterministic.
#
# Without this the repo had none, core.autocrlf decided per machine, and
# skills/cyberwise/SKILL.md sat at "i/lf w/mixed" - LF in the index, mixed in
# one working tree, uniform CRLF in a fresh checkout. Get-ToolIndex regenerates
# that table and compares it to the file, so the check passed on the machine
# that wrote it and could not pass anywhere else. CI called it drift six times.
#
# It also matters beyond that one test: upstream.manifest hashes file CONTENTS,
# so a repo whose bytes depend on who checked it out can never verify anywhere
# but where it was generated.
#
# This is a Windows-only toolkit - every tool is PowerShell and the suite
# asserts Windows paths - so CRLF in the working tree is the honest choice.
* text=auto eol=crlf

# Never touched.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.zip  binary
*.exe  binary
*.dll  binary
*.archive binary
